<title>BELGIUM: Brussels bourse sets new gold mines index divider.</title>
<headline>Brussels bourse sets new gold mines index divider.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels Stock Exchange said on Friday the divider for its B-Gold South African gold mines index would be changed as follows from Monday:</p>
<p>B-Gold price index   1,476,883  vs  1,410,828</p>
<p>B-Gold return index  1,263,446  vs  1,206,937</p>
<p>The bourse had previously announced the following changes to the index from Monday:</p>
<p>    Company		   No. Shares New (Old)</p>
<p>    Driefontein			    735 (930)</p>
<p>    Southvaal				 95 (120)</p>
<p>    Western Deep			   100 (125)</p>
<p>    Freegold				 430 (545)</p>
<p>    Vaal Reefs				70  (85)</p>
<p>    Avgold				 1,250  none</p>
<p>    Beatrix Mines			  350  none</p>
<p>    Harmony				  140  none</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
